                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The benefits are as follows: (1) Michigan Consolidated Gas Company Retirement Plan for Employees Covered by Collective Bargaining Agreements (\"Retirement Plan\"), as amended (including a surviving spouse annuity benefit), (2) MichCon Investment and Stock Ownership Plan (\"Investment Plan\"), as amended, (3) Group Life Insurance Plan, and (4) Group Accidental Death and Dismemberment Plan.",
            "block_bbox": [
                100,
