        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "With regards to the Retirement Plan, see paragraph (1) below, unit employees are eligible for coverage under this plan if they are a union employee of the Company, are at least 18 years old, and have completed at least 1,000 hours of service during any 12-month period that begins on the employee's first day of employment with the Company or any anniversary thereof.",
            "block_bbox": [
                99,
